OL,3,APolice begin operation to move migrants
OL,4,Afrom Ceuta beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have begun moving hundreds of
OL,7,Fmigrants in Ceuta to a new tented site
OL,8,Fin the port area of the Spanish
OL,9,Fterritory in north Africa.
OL,11,FOfficers struggled to contain crowds of
OL,12,Fpeople jostling to secure a place at
OL,13,Fthe site after weeks of living on the
OL,14,Fbeaches. Shots could be heard, with
OL,15,Freports that police fired into the air.
OL,17,FSeveral hundred migrants have now
OL,18,Freached the camp, which has a capacity
OL,19,Ffor 1,700 people.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
